[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 7681.109, "timestamp": "02:08:01", "text": "埃克桑德尔。 呃，你好。 但是，我可以向"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7685.189, "timestamp": "02:08:05", "text": "你保证，我没有以任何"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7688.149, "timestamp": "02:08:08", "text": "方式联系过你。 他们为什么要联系"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7691.589, "timestamp": "02:08:11", "text": "我？ 即使我当时处于"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7693.83, "timestamp": "02:08:13", "text": "醉酒状态或情绪低落，我也不认为在发生这一切之后，我真的主动"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7697.51, "timestamp": "02:08:17", "text": "联系过他们中的任何人"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7701.03, "timestamp": "02:08:21", "text": "。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7711.03, "timestamp": "02:08:31", "text": "如果我真的这么做了，他们就可以在推特上说："}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7714.229, "timestamp": "02:08:34", "text": "“哦，他试图联系我之"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7717.75, "timestamp": "02:08:37", "text": "类的。” 因为我能看出我正在这样"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7719.589, "timestamp": "02:08:39", "text": "做"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7730.709, "timestamp": "02:08:50", "text": "大多数把我拉黑或"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7733.35, "timestamp": "02:08:53", "text": "删除好友的人都无法再和我说话了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7735.43, "timestamp": "02:08:55", "text": "。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7738.229, "timestamp": "02:08:58", "text": "我只是觉得"}]